    "body": "For the nullable case you _could_ do:\r\n```\r\n    typedef [AllowShared] Uint8Array Something;\r\n```\r\nand then\r\n```\r\n  void foo(Something? arg);\r\n```\r\nto force the [AllowShared] to bind to the inner type, but it's kinda annoying...",
